#==================================================================================================#
#                              Nordix Package Selection Help                             #
#==================================================================================================#

Nordix installer package selection.

- Use SPACE to toggle packages on/off in the list.
- Use ENTER to confirm your selection.

Choosing Exit will skip the package selection.

Available package categories:

- Creative: content creation tools (Gimp, Blender, Krita, Inkscape, Shotcut, OBS, GPU Screen Recorder, Upscayl).
- Development: code editors and developer tools (Zed, Emacs, Neovim, Helix, Sublime).
- Gaming: game launchers and gaming utilities (Steam, Gamescope, Lutris, Heroic, ProtonPlus, Goverlay, Vesktop).
- Homelab: self hosted AI, SSH, virtualization and web based services (Docker, Ollama, LmStudio, Unsloth, Cockpit).
- Office & Utilities: office, archive and torrent tools (LibreOffice, PeaZip, Qbittorrent).

Press OK to confirm your package selection.